@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
hide empty description
[*] --> NoRun
NoRun : 인증된 coverage 없음
Accumulating : measured-true [start,end)의 합집합
Satisfied : covered duration >= duration

NoRun --> Accumulating : Measured true certificate
Accumulating --> Accumulating : 맞닿거나 겹치는\nMeasured true certificate
Accumulating --> Satisfied : coverage가 duration에 도달
Satisfied --> Satisfied : Measured true가 계속됨
Accumulating --> NoRun : false 또는 Measured가 아닌 증거,\n품질 fault (reset 하한)
Satisfied --> NoRun : false 또는 Measured가 아닌 증거,\n품질 fault (reset 하한)
Accumulating --> NoRun : source 또는 clock epoch 변경\n(새 chain)
Satisfied --> NoRun : source 또는 clock epoch 변경\n(새 chain)
note bottom of Accumulating
  NoObservation: NotReady, coverage를 더하지 않음.
  중복은 coverage를 전진시키지 않음.
  잘못된 입력: 거부, commit된 상태는 그대로.
end note
@enduml
